   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Scale for cut. v1's generator, at its shipped limit of 4 flags, writes 75,172 command lines from its reference grammar, 11,651 of them distinct (measured here); cut accepts 1,783,\nof which 360 do real work (the rest carry --help or --version). The agent ran cut 21 times before writing and 45 times after, all hand-chosen.",
   "originalText": "Scale for cut. v1's generator, at its shipped limit of 4 flags, writes 75,172 command lines from its reference grammar, 11,651 of them distinct (measured here); cut accepts 1,783,\nof which 360 do real work (the rest carry --help or --version). The agent ran cut 21 times before writing and 45 times after, all hand-chosen.",
